  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence contains an apostrophe error?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence is not written correctly?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence contains a mistake in grammar or punctuation?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence contains an error in the use of commas?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which one of these sentences contains an error?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence contains an error in end punctuation?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence contains an error in standard usage?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence contains an error in agreement?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence contains an error in quotation punctuation?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence contains an error in a plural form?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence has a mistake in it?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which of these is a sentence fragment rather than a complete sentence?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence is a run-on sentence?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence contains an error in punctuation?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence contains an error in wording?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence contains an error in verb tense?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence contains an error in subject-verb agreement?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence contains an error in punctuation or usage?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence contains an error in the placement of a modifier?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence contains an error in the punctuation of a quotation?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence contains an error in parallel structure?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence contains an error a careful editor would flag?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence contains an error in comparison?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence contains an error in the use of a semicolon or colon?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which word below is misspelled?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Choose the misspelled word.')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which of these words is spelled incorrectly?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which word contains a spelling error?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'One of these words is spelled incorrectly. Which one?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which word is misspelled in this group?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Select the misspelled word.')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which of the following words is spelled incorrectly?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence best combines these two sentences? ''The storm knocked down a tree.'' and ''The tree blocked our driveway.''')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence is the clearest and most concise?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence best introduces a paragraph about the benefits of reading for pleasure?')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which transition best completes the sentence? ''The bridge was closed for repairs; ______, drivers had to take the long way around town.''')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which sentence does NOT belong in this paragraph? (1) Sea otters spend nearly their whole lives in the water. (2) Their thick fur traps air and keeps them warm in cold currents. (3) Kelp is harvested commercially for use in ice cream and toothpaste. (4) Otters often wrap themselves in kelp so they do not drift away while sleeping.')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Sentences 1-4 appear in scrambled order. Which arrangement makes the most logical paragraph? 1. The dough must then rest for an hour so the gluten relaxes. 2. Begin by stirring the flour, water, and yeast together in a large bowl. 3. Once it has doubled in size, punch it down and shape it into a loaf. 4. Knead the mixture until it is smooth and springs back when pressed.')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Where does this sentence best fit? ''Even so, the cost of the equipment kept many schools from joining.'' Paragraph: (1) The new robotics league promised to reach students in every district. (2) Organizers waived entry fees and provided free coaching. (3) By spring, only a dozen teams had registered. (4) Next year the league plans to lend kits to any school that asks.')::UUID,
  md5('language' || '|' || 'Which revision best improves this sentence? ''The report, which was written by the committee, contained recommendations that were made about how the budget should be handled in the future.''')::UUID,
